(exit 0)

### device setup stops for --yes
$ devnet-dvpn device setup --allowance 3
One transaction:
  - Change this device's spending limit from 2000 to 3 tDVPN
Re-run with --yes to do it.
(exit 2)

### daemon install stops for --yes
$ devnet-dvpn daemon install
Install and start the VPN service (one administrator prompt). With kill switch on, a stopped session blocks internet until you disconnect or restore network.
Re-run with --yes to do it.
(exit 2)

### daemon set stops for --yes
$ devnet-dvpn daemon set --kill-switch on
Apply service settings and restart it (one administrator prompt):
{
  "killSwitch": "on",
  "allowLan": false,
  "dnsServers": [
    "1.1.1.1",
